Authored by Codex (gpt-5.6-sol, xhigh) from a scoped brief; verified live via CDP.

- Library: hierarchical tree (folder kickers + glyphs, indent guides, crimson
  active bar), header stats + icon actions, document header (kicker breadcrumb,
  word count, saved-state pill), chat-rail-style tabs, card Links/Backlinks
  panels with counts; note-editor prose scale/heading/wikilink polish;
  pdf-viewer toolbar touch-up
- Recorder: capture-desk hero (circular record button, ready kicker, headline),
  toggle-switch option rows, privacy pill, ARCHIVE kicker + count badge,
  recording cards (tinted mic tile, meta line, tooltipped icon actions),
  legal paragraph -> one-line 'Local by design' + details tooltip
- visual-only: no behavior/IPC/storage changes; tokens + existing primitives
